### Create Draft Invoice
POST http://localhost:8000/api/draft-invoices/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": 2,
  "invoice_type": "individual",
  "gst_type": "cgst_sgst",
  "mode_of_supply": "direct",
  "transportation_mode": "road"
}

### Fetch Draft Invoice
GET http://localhost:8000/api/payment-stats/


### Add Draft Invoice Item
POST http://localhost:8000/api/draft-items/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "draft_invoice": 10,
  "product": 1,
  "quantity": 4,
  "special_discount": 0
}

### List Draft Invoice
GET http://localhost:8000/api/draft-invoices/

### Finalize Draft → Invoice
POST http://localhost:8000/api/draft-invoices/9/finalize/
Content-Type: application/json


### List Final Invoices
GET http://localhost:8000/api/invoices/5/


### Final Invoice Cancel
POST http://localhost:8000/api/invoices/5/cancel/
Content-Type: application/json

### Customer Returned Product
POST http://localhost:8000/api/credit-notes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoice": 5,
  "reason": "Customer returned product",
  "amount": "93811.00"
}

