# API Documentation for Invoice Creation

### Direct Invoice Creation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/invoices/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": 1,
  "invoice_type": "individual",
  "gst_type": "cgst_sgst",
  "mode_of_supply": "direct",
  "transportation_mode": "road",
  "tax_status": "unpaid",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "special_discount": 0,
      "net_value": 1000.00,
      "gst_amount": 180.00,
      "cgst_amount": 90.00,
      "sgst_amount": 90.00,
      "igst_amount": 0.00,
      "item_total": 1180.00
    },
    {
      "product_id": 2,
      "quantity": 2,
      "special_discount": 10,
      "net_value": 2000.00,
      "gst_amount": 360.00,
      "cgst_amount": 180.00,
      "sgst_amount": 180.00,
      "igst_amount": 0.00,
      "item_total": 2360.00
    }
  ]
}

