### Create a Purchase with Purchase Items

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/purchase/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor": 2,
  "invoice_number": "INV-12345",
  "purchase_date": "2025-10-12",
  "discount": 1000.00,
  "amount_paid": 800.00,
  "status": "pending",
  "items": [
    {
      "product": 1,
      "quantity": 10,
      "unit_cost": 100.00,
      "total_cost": 1000.00,
      "gst_percentage": 18.00,
      "total_tax": 180.00,
      "item_total": 1180.00
    },
    {
      "product": 5,
      "quantity": 5,
      "unit_cost": 150.00,
      "total_cost": 750.00,
      "gst_percentage": 18.00,
      "total_tax": 135.00,
      "item_total": 885.00
    }
  ]
}

